        "filing_date": "2025-11-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide management services to four publicly traded equity real estate investment trusts, or REITs, three of whose securities are listed on The Nasdaq Stock Market LLC, or Nasdaq, and one of whose securities are listed on the OTC Markets Group Inc., or OTCPK: Diversified Healthcare Trust, a Maryland REIT, including its subsidiaries, or DHC;",
