        "filing_date": "2025-11-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As manager of the Managed Equity REITs, we are responsible for implementing investment strategies and managing day-to-day operations, subject to supervision and oversight by each Managed Equity REIT’s board of trustees.",
