        "filing_date": "2025-11-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a vertically integrated manager and as of September 30, 2025, we employed nearly 900 real estate professionals in more than 30 offices throughout the United States.",
