        "filing_date": "2025-11-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have strengthened our alignment with the TCFD by advancing the depth of our alignment with all four pillars of the TCFD framework and we developed a tool to help assess building energy and emissions performance standards across the U.S.",
